      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCIB001-0003",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "办理本业务应遵循\"**并购真实、主体合格、偿付可测、整合可行**\"四项原则；四项中任一无法论证的，不予受理。",
      "quoteHash": "122e999895f7e9a5276aa5d92ecf8d651381d620bad395979e5fffe5478b3fb7",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
