      "sourceId": "SRC-IB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-IB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCIB001-20260922-45bd3306",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCIB001-0d786a4c",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCIB001-0004",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "并购方（借款人）应同时满足：一、依法登记并存续，具备相应行业经营资质；二、内部评级不低于本行并购贷款准入线（见 `SRC-XFAM-001`）；三、已核定并购贷款专项额度；四、并购交易真实、合法，且已就交易背景完成核验（按 `SRC-TF-003`）。",
      "quoteHash": "0d786a4c006c7ee698919c163b9c34c1a8eac72bab921981e6181fe742b46684",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "45bd33064e341f1f9a4848841e7bbf6915cd465651f32bd62ad09dc37a4e67b9",
      "sourceId": "SRC-IB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-IB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCIB001-20260922-45bd3306",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCIB001-a1c6fdef",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCIB001-0006",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "下列情形**不得**受理：一、并购交易真实性或合法性无法确认；二、并购方**无实际控制或整合能力**且无可行整合方案；三、交易目的为**规避监管、圈地或变相融资**；四、涉及本行限制类行业或名单。",
      "quoteHash": "a1c6fdeff03525be540185a7cc758cde2d7bb178a7fad5890082d4f355c4b771",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
