      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCIB001-0012",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "并购贷款**利率**适用《产品定价管理办法》（`SRC-XFAM-002`）及本行利率管理规定，**不得**低于本行成本与风险下限审批发放。",
      "quoteHash": "f58ddf02f44d90a463aa5328b1226d0465133e85677eb3af8e74cd5905701249",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "45bd33064e341f1f9a4848841e7bbf6915cd465651f32bd62ad09dc37a4e67b9",
      "sourceId": "SRC-IB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-IB-001.DEMO.md",
